	\endlastfoot
	$i$ & Compartment index, $i\in\{S,E,A,C,L,R\}$ \\[4pt]
	$N_i$ & Operator that collects all terms of the $i$-th equation on the left-hand side, so that $N_i=0$ is the original equation \\[4pt]
	$\mathcal{L}$ & Linear operator, $\mathcal{L}[\phi_i]=d\phi_i/dt$ \\[4pt]
	$q\in[0,1]$ & Embedding parameter: $q=0$ gives the initial approximation and $q=1$ gives the solution of the original system \\[4pt]
	$\phi_i(t;q)$ & Deformation function of compartment $i$. It moves continuously from $x_{i,0}(t)$ at $q=0$ to $x_i(t)$ at $q=1$ \\[4pt]
